# Ignore everything
*

# Except budmed-news (GitHub repo root)
!budmed-news/
budmed-news/**

# Whitelist specific contents inside budmed-news
!budmed-news/index.html
!budmed-news/css/
!budmed-news/css/**
!budmed-news/js/
!budmed-news/js/**
!budmed-news/assets/
!budmed-news/assets/**
!budmed-news/articles/
!budmed-news/articles/**
!budmed-news/admin/
!budmed-news/admin/**
!budmed-news/_data/
!budmed-news/_data/**
!budmed-news/README.md

# Also whitelist root-level web essentials (in case repo moves)
!index.html
!css/
!css/**
!js/
!js/**
!assets/
!assets/**
!articles/
!articles/**
!admin/
!admin/**
!_data/
!_data/**
!README.md
!.gitignore

# Ignore OS/IDE files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Ignore logs
*.log
